Art. 104b
Inserted by No I of the O of 19 May 2021 (AS 2021 281). Repealed by Annex 5 No 1 of the O of 4 May 2022 on In Vitro Diagnostic Medical Devices, with effect from 26 Mai 2022 (AS 2022 291).
